 "description": "\u00d6SYM'nin y\u0131ll\u0131k s\u0131nav takvimi: YKS, KPSS, ALES, YDS, DGS, TUS, MS\u00dc ve di\u011ferleri i\u00e7in ba\u015fvuru, ge\u00e7 ba\u015fvuru, s\u0131nav, sonu\u00e7 ve tercih tarihleri, \u00d6SYM'nin a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131yla. T\u00fcrkiye's national exam calendar (university entrance, civil-service, graduate and language exams) from the testing authority: application, exam, result and preference dates. Varsay\u0131lan: yaln\u0131zca gelecekteki ad\u0131mlar (bir tarihi bug\u00fcnden ileride olan sat\u0131rlar); `ara` ile s\u0131nav ad\u0131 filtresi. Saatler T\u00fcrkiye saatidir.",
